---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import FeatureCard from '../../components/FeatureCard.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Best Troops.ai Alternatives in 2025 (After Salesforce Acquisition)"
  description="Troops.ai was acquired by Salesforce and shut down. Compare the best alternatives: Pyko, Rattle, Scratchpad, Luru, and Momentum for Salesforce-Slack integration."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="gradient-hero py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-200 text-sm mb-6">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg>
          Troops.ai has been shut down
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
          Best Troops.ai Alternatives for 2025
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Troops was acquired by Salesforce in 2022 and discontinued. Here are the best alternatives for Salesforce-Slack integration with real-time alerts and CRM actions.
        </p>
        <Button href="/trial" variant="primary" size="lg">
          Try Pyko Free
        </Button>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-4">Migrate from Troops in minutes. No credit card required.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Happened Section -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="color: #061A35;">What Happened to Troops.ai?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Salesforce acquired Troops.ai in July 2022. Since then, Troops has been gradually sunset and users have been pushed to migrate to <strong>Slack Sales Elevate</strong> at $60/user/month. However, Slack Elevate is not a 1:1 replacement for Troops' features.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            If you relied on Troops for Salesforce alerts, deal rooms, or bi-directional CRM sync, you'll need a third-party alternative to maintain the same functionality.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comparison Table -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Compare Troops.ai Alternatives
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 text-center mb-12">
          Feature-by-feature comparison of the top Troops replacements.
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full border-collapse bg-white text-gray-700">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <th class="text-left p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Feature</th>
                <th class="text-center p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Slack Elevate</th>
                <th class="text-center p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Rattle</th>
                <th class="text-center p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Scratchpad</th>
                <th class="text-center p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #F94730;">Pyko</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="bg-white">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Real-Time Alerts</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes (&lt;3s)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Update CRM from Slack</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Limited</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-white">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">HubSpot Support</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Microsoft Teams</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-white">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">CRM Data Hygiene</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Limited</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes (Auto)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">No-Code Setup</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-white">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Pricing</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">$60/user/mo</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Contact sales</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">$0 platform fee</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center font-semibold" style="color: #F94730;">From €3.99/user</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Best For</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-sm">All-Salesforce orgs</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-sm">Salesforce + Slack</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-sm">Pipeline management</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #F94730;">Teams wanting value</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Pyko Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#061A35] to-[#0A2342]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] text-white text-sm font-medium mb-4">Recommended</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            Why Choose Pyko Over Other Alternatives
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
            The only Troops alternative with multi-CRM and multi-channel support.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Works with HubSpot Too</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Unlike Rattle and Scratchpad, Pyko supports both Salesforce AND HubSpot. Perfect if you have teams on different CRMs or are considering a migration.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Slack AND Microsoft Teams</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Rattle, Scratchpad, and Slack Elevate are Slack-only. Pyko works with both Slack and Microsoft Teams, giving you flexibility as your team grows.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v4"/><path d="m6.8 14-3.5 2"/><path d="m20.7 16-3.5-2"/><path d="M6.8 10 3.3 8"/><path d="m20.7 8-3.5 2"/><path d="m9 22 3-8 3 8"/><path d="M8 22h8"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Automated Data Hygiene</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Pyko's Cleaning Rules automatically detect stale data, missing fields, and outdated close dates. Get alerts AND one-click fixes, not just notifications.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">True Real-Time (&lt;3 seconds)</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Pyko uses Salesforce Platform Events for instant delivery. No polling delays. Your team gets alerts within 1-3 seconds of CRM changes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <Button href="/trial" variant="primary" size="lg">
            Migrate from Troops Free
          </Button>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-4">14-day free trial. No credit card required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Detailed Alternatives -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          All Troops Alternatives Reviewed
        </h2>

        <!-- Slack Elevate -->
        <div class="mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: #061A35;">Slack Sales Elevate (Salesforce's Replacement)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Salesforce's official replacement for Troops. It's native to Slack and Salesforce but comes with a hefty $60/user/month price tag.
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-green-800 mb-2">Pros:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-green-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Native Salesforce integration</li>
                <li>Official Salesforce support</li>
                <li>Deep Slack integration</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-red-800 mb-2">Cons:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-red-700 space-y-1">
                <li>$60/user/month (expensive)</li>
                <li>Not a true 1:1 Troops replacement</li>
                <li>Salesforce-only (no HubSpot)</li>
                <li>Slack-only (no Teams)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Rattle -->
        <div class="mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: #061A35;">Rattle</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Rattle is the most commonly mentioned Troops alternative. It offers bi-directional Salesforce-Slack sync with no-code workflow building.
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-green-800 mb-2">Pros:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-green-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Strong Troops feature parity</li>
                <li>No-code workflow builder</li>
                <li>Good support and onboarding</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-red-800 mb-2">Cons:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-red-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Salesforce-only</li>
                <li>Slack-only</li>
                <li>Enterprise pricing (contact sales)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Scratchpad -->
        <div class="mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: #061A35;">Scratchpad</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Scratchpad focuses on pipeline management and sales productivity. They offer free Troops migration and don't charge platform fees.
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-green-800 mb-2">Pros:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-green-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Free Troops migration</li>
                <li>No platform fees</li>
                <li>Deal Rooms in Slack</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-red-800 mb-2">Cons:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-red-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Salesforce-only</li>
                <li>Slack-only</li>
                <li>More focused on pipeline than alerts</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Luru -->
        <div class="mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: #061A35;">Luru</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Luru offers Salesforce-Slack integration with a focus on revenue intelligence and deal tracking.
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-green-800 mb-2">Pros:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-green-700 space-y-1">
                <li>One-click Slack setup</li>
                <li>CRM action buttons in chat</li>
                <li>Revenue intelligence features</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-red-800 mb-2">Cons:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-red-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Salesforce-only</li>
                <li>Slack-only</li>
                <li>Smaller company</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Momentum -->
        <div class="mb-10">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: #061A35;">Momentum</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Momentum focuses on GTM and RevOps teams with deal rooms, AI summaries, and pipeline automation.
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-green-800 mb-2">Pros:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-green-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Smart Deal Rooms</li>
                <li>AI-generated summaries</li>
                <li>GTM workflow automation</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-red-800 mb-2">Cons:</p>
              <ul class="text-sm text-red-700 space-y-1">
                <li>Salesforce-only</li>
                <li>Slack-only</li>
                <li>Enterprise-focused pricing</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Is Troops.ai still available?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">No. Troops was acquired by Salesforce in July 2022 and has been discontinued. Salesforce is pushing former Troops users to Slack Sales Elevate.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">What's the closest replacement for Troops?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Rattle and Pyko offer the most similar feature sets to Troops. Pyko has the advantage of supporting both HubSpot and Microsoft Teams, while Rattle is Salesforce/Slack only.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Can I migrate my Troops workflows?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Most alternatives offer migration support. Scratchpad specifically advertises free Troops migration. Pyko can replicate most Troops workflows within minutes using templates.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Which alternative works with HubSpot?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Pyko is the only major Troops alternative that supports HubSpot. All others (Rattle, Scratchpad, Luru, Momentum) are Salesforce-only.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Which alternative works with Microsoft Teams?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Pyko is the only major Troops alternative that supports Microsoft Teams. All others are Slack-only.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Is Slack Sales Elevate worth $60/user/month?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">For companies fully committed to the Salesforce ecosystem, it may be worth it. However, third-party alternatives often offer more features at a lower price point, with greater flexibility.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <CTASection
    headline="Ready to replace Troops?"
    subheadline="Migrate in minutes. Get real-time alerts in Slack or Teams."
    primaryCTA={{ text: "Start Free 14-Day Trial", href: "/trial" }}
    secondaryCTA={{ text: "See All Features", href: "/product/live-alerts" }}
    variant="gradient"
  />
</MainLayout>
